Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.32,0:02:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第3季第10集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.90,0:00:11.36,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.41,0:01:02.37,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.24,0:06:36.13,Note,0,0,0,0,,（西摩兰医学院 沃特·格雷格博士）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.58,0:08:02.92,Note,0,0,0,0,,（匹兹堡市警局）
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.20,0:25:25.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（两天后）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.32,0:00:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Dad's gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.37,0:00:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得继承他的遗志\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to carry out his legacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.20,0:00:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that means hunting down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.04,0:00:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,能猎杀多少凶鬼恶灵杀多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}as many evil sons of bitches as we possibly can.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.17,0:00:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莉莎 - 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lisa. - Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.17,0:00:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想多留一阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you wanna stick around for a while…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.79,0:00:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're welcome to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.05,0:00:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.76,0:00:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有很多工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a lot of work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.17,0:00:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也不是我的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's not my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.59,0:00:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她真名叫贝拉·塔伯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bela Talbot's her real name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.22,0:00:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为特定客户获取一些独特的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I procure unique items for a select clientele.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.14,0:00:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.01,0:00:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是神偷\N{\fnArial\fs30}A great thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.35,0:00:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 你想打破迪恩的恶魔交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you wanna break Dean free of that demon deal…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.31,0:00:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,答案是不会写在哪本书里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you ain't gonna find the answer in no book.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.14,0:00:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那要去哪找 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then where, Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.31,0:00:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子 我知道就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid, I wish I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.11,0:00:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在努力保住你的命 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been busting my ass trying to keep you alive, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.15,0:00:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却一副毫不在乎的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you act like you couldn't care less.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.61,0:00:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望你担心我 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want you to worry about me, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.78,0:00:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你担心你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to worry about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.45,0:00:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你在乎你要死了这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to give a crap that you're dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.62,0:00:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个可恶的恶魔 都曾是人类吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every damn demon, they were all human once?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.08,0:00:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个我见过的都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every one I've ever met.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.54,0:00:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 答案是「是」\N{\fnArial\fs30}The answer is yes, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.91,0:00:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也会遭遇一样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same thing will happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.37,0:00:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本没办法让我不下地狱 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way of saving me from the pit, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.42,0:00:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.64,0:01:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.61,0:02:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.99,0:02:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.33,0:02:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒 听到了吗 醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up, you hear me? Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.79,0:02:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.88,0:02:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.84,0:02:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need some help in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.35,0:02:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.33,0:02:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里啊 你干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.16,0:02:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.17,0:03:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才下午2点 你还喝上威士忌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 2 in the afternoon. You're drinking whiskey?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.42,0:03:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我一向喝威士忌 - 你才不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I drink whiskey all the time. - No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.29,0:03:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且这有什么大不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.46,0:03:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也会在酒吧买醉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get sloppy in bars,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.88,0:03:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,经常泡妞\N{\fnArial\fs30}you hit on chicks all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.96,0:03:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么就不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.80,0:03:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里选择不多啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of slim pickings around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.51,0:03:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.14,0:03:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽力了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.94,0:03:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}To do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.15,0:03:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}To save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.03,0:03:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以给我来杯威士忌吗 双份 不加冰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could I get a whiskey, double, neat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.28,0:03:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我说真的 迪恩 - 不 你喝醉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm serious, Dean. - No, you're drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.33,0:03:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, where you're going…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.08,0:03:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要变成的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}what you're gonna become.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.96,0:03:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.71,0:03:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开始觉得或许露比也无法阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm starting to think maybe even Ruby can't stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.55,0:03:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但其实 没人能救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But really, the thing is, no one can save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.64,0:03:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不一直这么说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I've been telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.51,0:03:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不是这意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's not what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.47,0:03:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 没人能救你 因为你不想被救\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, no one can save you because you don't wanna be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.02,0:04:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能这么不在乎你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, how can you care so little about yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.81,0:04:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是有什么毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.11,0:04:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.45,0:04:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我是斯奈德森先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, this is Mr. Sniderson.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.50,0:04:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.83,0:04:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.96,0:04:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,诊断是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's the diagnosis?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.47,0:04:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们进行了一切能想到的检测\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've tested everything we can think to test.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.05,0:04:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他似乎非常健康\N{\fnArial\fs30}He seems perfectly healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.51,0:04:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但却陷入了昏迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except that he's comatose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.76,0:04:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯奈德森先生 你是他的紧急联系人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Sniderson, you're his emergency contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.06,0:04:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么我们该了解的情况吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything we should know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.68,0:04:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么疾病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any illnesses?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.31,0:04:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他从不生病 他都不感冒\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he never gets sick. I mean, he doesn't even catch cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.23,0:04:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生 你能做点什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor, is there anything you can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.03,0:04:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 但我们都不知道病因是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm sorry, but we don't know what's causing it…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.86,0:04:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们也不知道怎么治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we don't know how to treat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.53,0:04:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.53,0:04:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}went to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.20,0:05:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,再没醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and didn't wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.05,0:05:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比怎么会在匹兹堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what was Bobby doing in Pittsburgh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.47,0:05:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非他是来度很无聊的假\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, unless he was taking an extremely lame vacation…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.68,0:05:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定是来办案的 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he must have been working a job, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.68,0:05:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,按说应该能看到些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you think there'd be some sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.22,0:05:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,迹象 什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}sign or something, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.69,0:05:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}Research,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.61,0:05:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,新闻剪报\N{\fnArial\fs30}news clippings…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.82,0:05:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至是披萨盒或啤酒罐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or a frigging pizza box or a beer can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.79,0:05:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.55,0:05:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比啊 总是注意掩盖行踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good old Bobby, always covering up his tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.88,0:05:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能看出点头绪来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make heads or tails of any of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.01,0:06:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,「非洲梦根」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Silene capensis, "
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.51,0:06:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全不知道这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}which, of course, means absolutely nothing to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.14,0:06:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 讣告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, obit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.64,0:06:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,「沃特·格雷格博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dr. Walter Gregg,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.02,0:06:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,64岁 大学神经学家「\N{\fnArial\fs30}64, university neurologist."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.73,0:06:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd he bite it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.61,0:06:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 死因不明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, they don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.53,0:06:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面说 他睡着了 再就没醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say he just went to sleep and didn't wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.74,0:06:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,听上去耳熟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sound familiar to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.07,0:06:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.45,0:06:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许鲍比在查博士的死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's say Bobby was looking into the doc's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.79,0:06:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在猎杀什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, hunting after something…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.91,0:06:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西反开始猎杀他\N{\fnArial\fs30}That started hunting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.04,0:06:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.04,0:06:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 你留下 看看能不能理出点头绪来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Stay here. See if you can make heads or tails of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.21,0:06:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.04,0:06:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己去查查这位博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna look into the good doctor myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.13,0:06:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是格雷格博士的实验室助理\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're Dr. Gregg's lab assistant?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.84,0:06:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.18,0:06:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的死肯定让你很震惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, his death must have come as a shock to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.43,0:06:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.93,0:06:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 在睡梦中安然离去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, still, go in your sleep, peaceful…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.44,0:06:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也会希望能如此吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you wish for, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.65,0:06:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.90,0:06:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷格博士是研究睡眠障碍的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Gregg, uh, studied sleeping disorders?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.78,0:06:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.36,0:06:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.28,0:07:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切我都跟另一位警探说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went over all of this with the other detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.28,0:07:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经有别的警探找过你了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You already spoke to another detective?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.57,0:07:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 一位和气的长胡子的老先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. A very nice older man with a beard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.29,0:07:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果可以 我想再听一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'd love to hear it again if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.87,0:07:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 我还挺忙 或许稍后的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thing is, I'm sort of busy. Maybe we could do this later?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.46,0:07:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.21,0:07:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天下午晚些时候我带你去趟警局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just bring you down to the station later this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.84,0:07:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的口供录下来 正式点\N{\fnArial\fs30}And get your statement on tape, do it all official-like.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.84,0:07:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我原本不知道格雷格博士做的实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, okay, I didn't know about Dr. Gregg's experiments.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.18,0:07:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我整理他文件时才发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not until I was cleaning out his files.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.60,0:07:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的实验是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}His experiments…?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.18,0:07:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于睡眠的那些吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ones he was conducting on sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.31,0:07:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人知道 大学不知道 谁都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one knew, okay? Not the university, not anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.27,0:07:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经问过律师了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already spoke with a lawyer,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.36,0:07:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说 我不需要为任何事负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he told me that I can't be held liable for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.36,0:07:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you couldn't,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.40,0:07:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那是新证据出现之前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that was before the new evidence came to light.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.16,0:07:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,新证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}New evidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.82,0:07:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么新证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}What new evidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.95,0:07:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我不便透露\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not at liberty to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.00,0:07:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是个研究生 做这个只是为挣学费\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm just a grad student, this was a gig to cover tuition.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.92,0:07:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许吧 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe so. But, uh, still this…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.46,0:07:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可能会被记入你的永久记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}this could go on your permanent record.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.67,0:07:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你把博士的研究交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you hand over the doctor's research to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.13,0:08:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.55,0:08:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道宿舍助理说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't know what the RA said, but,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.89,0:08:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我只是在种蕨类植物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was growing ferns.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.35,0:08:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,别激动 小子 我不是为此而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy, Phish, that's not why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.19,0:08:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.90,0:08:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.98,0:08:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想找你问问格雷格博士的睡眠研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna talk to you about Dr. Gregg's sleep study.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.48,0:08:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 格雷格博士死了 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Dr. Gregg just died, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.61,0:08:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你曾是他的实验对象之一 是吧 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You were one of his test subjects, right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.83,0:08:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你在执勤什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you're on duty or whatever?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.29,0:08:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也可以破个例\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I can make an exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.46,0:08:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷格博士在测试的治疗是针对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Dr. Gregg was testing treatments for a,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.01,0:08:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,「夏-威二氏综合征」的\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Charcot-Wilbrand syndrome"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.14,0:08:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means…?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.77,0:08:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.89,0:08:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能做梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.35,0:08:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我小时候出过自行车事故\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had this bike accident when I was a kid…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.77,0:08:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,脑袋撞坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I banged my head pretty good and.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.57,0:09:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,此后再就没做过梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't had a dream since.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.86,0:09:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到参与这项研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till the study. You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.03,0:09:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,算是做了梦吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.66,0:09:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士给了你什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd the doc give you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.53,0:09:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种黄色的茶\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's this yellow tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.70,0:09:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,气味很恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}It smelled awful,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.20,0:09:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝起来更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}tasted worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.08,0:09:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,它有什么效果\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did it do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.83,0:09:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我昏睡了过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just passed right out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.25,0:09:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了个特别逼真强烈的梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I had the most vivid, super-intense dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.79,0:09:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就像不好的迷幻剂体验 - 了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like a bad acid trip, you know? - Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.92,0:09:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…不了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.01,0:09:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.42,0:09:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后我就退出了研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dropped out of the study right after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.51,0:09:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢那感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.64,0:09:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说\N{\fnArial\fs30}To tell you the truth…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.06,0:09:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那让我害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it kind of scared me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.12,0:09:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.33,0:09:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}No change.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.08,0:09:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你查到什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.16,0:09:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据你告诉我的博士的实验的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, considering what you told me about the doc's experiments…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.42,0:09:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比墙上的东西就能理出头绪来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby's wall is starting to make hell of a lot more sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.71,0:10:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么说 - 这种植物\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How so? - This plant, Silene capensis…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.04,0:10:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,被称为非洲梦根\N{\fnArial\fs30}is also known as African Dream Root.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.63,0:10:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,数世纪以来都有萨满巫师和巫医使用它\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been used by shaman and medicine men for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.67,0:10:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜猜 他们服药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess. They dose up…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.43,0:10:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后拿出土著乐器 跳起土著舞蹈\N{\fnArial\fs30}bust out didjeridus, and start kicking around the hackey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.80,0:10:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.89,0:10:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你相信传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you believe the legends…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.56,0:10:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是用于梦行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's used for dreamwalking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.22,0:10:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入他人的梦境\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, entering another person's dreams,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.18,0:10:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他们脑袋里转悠\N{\fnArial\fs30}poking around in their heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.35,0:10:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们相信传说咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take it we believe the legends?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.52,0:10:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们什么时候不信了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.81,0:10:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但梦行还只是冰山一角\N{\fnArial\fs30}But dreamwalking is just the tip of the iceberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.02,0:10:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.57,0:10:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这梦根法力强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, this Dream Root is some serious mojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.48,0:10:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你服得够多 练得够多\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take enough of it, with practice,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.07,0:10:27.07,Title,0,0,0,0,,你基本上能成为《猛鬼街》里的弗莱迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can become a regular Freddy Krueger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.20,0:10:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以控制一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can control anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.20,0:10:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以把噩梦变好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could turn bad dreams good,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.74,0:10:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,把好梦变坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}you could turn good dreams bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.37,0:10:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能在人的梦里杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And killing people in their sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.62,0:10:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}For example.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.75,0:10:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's say…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.62,0:10:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,假设博士拿他的病人试了这玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's say this doc was testing this stuff on his patients,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.67,0:10:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像当初测试迷幻剂的蒂姆·莱利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tim Leary-style.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.71,0:10:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人生他的气 便决定潜入他的梦境\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody gets pissed at him, decides to give him a dream visit…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.17,0:10:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就长眠了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he goes nighty-night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.34,0:10:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那鲍比呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.26,0:10:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果杀手也找上了他 他怎么还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if the killer came after him, how come he's still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.35,0:10:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.36,0:11:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.03,0:11:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.03,0:11:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.42,0:11:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要怎么找到杀人睡魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how do we find our homicidal sandman?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.04,0:11:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可能是任何人 - 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Could be anyone. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.50,0:11:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 任何认识博士的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Anyone who knew the doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.84,0:11:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能拿到他的梦根\N{\fnArial\fs30}and had access to his dream shrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.42,0:11:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是他的哪个实验对象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe one of his test subjects or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.43,0:11:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能吧 但他的研究不怎么靠谱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possible. But his research was pretty sketchy. I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.51,0:11:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道他有多少实验对象 他们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how many subjects he had or who all of them were.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.31,0:11:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.48,0:11:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,换了是其他案子 我们现在肯定会\N{\fnArial\fs30}In any other case, we'd be calling Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.89,0:11:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,联系鲍比 向他求助\N{\fnArial\fs30}and asking him for help right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.73,0:11:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.23,0:11:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.94,0:11:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去跟他谈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.28,0:11:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 但那样对话可能会比较单边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, I think we might find the conversation a bit one-sided.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.15,0:11:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非我们也服用梦根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if we're tripping on some Dream Root.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.28,0:11:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - You heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.20,0:11:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去鲍比脑袋里梦行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna go dreamwalking inside Bobby's head?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.12,0:11:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,有何不可 或许我们能帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Why not? Maybe we could help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.24,0:11:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都不知道里面有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no idea what's crawling around in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.95,0:11:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能有多糟 - 很糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How bad could it be? - Bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.33,0:12:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 这可是鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, it's Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.54,0:12:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.63,0:12:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有个问题 我们没有非洲梦根\N{\fnArial\fs30}One problem, though, we're fresh out of African Dream Root.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.42,0:12:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你认识个能找到梦根的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So unless you know someone who can score some…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.85,0:12:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Crap. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.93,0:12:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 贝拉 - 贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bela. - Bela?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.60,0:12:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.27,0:12:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是在提议我们向她求助吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're actually suggesting we ask her a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.06,0:12:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我光想想都觉得恶心 但是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm feeling dirty just thinking about it, but yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.92,0:12:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.00,0:12:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 我没想到你真会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bela, I didn't think there's a chance in hell you'd show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.17,0:12:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是充满惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm full of surprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.97,0:12:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though, truthfully…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.55,0:12:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想知道我为什么来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you wanna know why I'm here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.26,0:12:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.93,0:13:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.21,0:13:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.48,0:13:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我脑子里都是你 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't stop thinking about you. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.70,0:13:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.62,0:13:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 萨姆 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam. Sam. Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.29,0:13:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.71,0:13:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 你睡得好香\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, you were out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.42,0:13:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,还发出了特幸福的叫声\N{\fnArial\fs30}And making some serious happy noises.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.38,0:13:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你梦到谁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who were you dreaming about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.68,0:13:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 没谁 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No one. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.64,0:13:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 告诉我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. You can tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.51,0:13:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安吉丽娜·朱莉 - 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Angelina Jolie? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.26,0:13:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 布拉德·皮特吗 - 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Brad Pitt? - No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.93,0:13:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 那不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.39,0:13:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.39,0:13:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.31,0:13:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我联系贝拉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I called Bela.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.07,0:13:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bela? Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.11,0:13:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怎么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd she, you know, say?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.07,0:13:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会帮我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She gonna help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.70,0:14:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,令人震惊啊 不会 我们又回到了原点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shockingly, no, which puts us back to square one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.58,0:14:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在破译博士的笔记\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been trying to decipher the doctor's notes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.87,0:14:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾 他的笔迹比你还潦草\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, he has worse handwriting than you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.71,0:14:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要来帮帮我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna come help me with this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.46,0:14:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 稍等下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah. Just give me a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.31,0:14:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 真是没想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bela. As I live and breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.53,0:14:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你联系了我 记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You called me. Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.40,0:14:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得你拒绝了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember you turning me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.03,0:14:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是充满惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm just full of surprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.78,0:14:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 你好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bela. What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.95,0:14:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你拿来了非洲梦根\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought you your African Dream Root.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.66,0:14:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,很厉害的东西 不好得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nasty stuff, and not easy to come by.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.29,0:14:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么突然改变了心意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the sudden change of heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.13,0:14:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就不能偶尔卖个人情了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, I can't do you a little favor every now and again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.88,0:14:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.09,0:14:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧 我想知道你有什么条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, come on, I wanna know what the strings are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.26,0:14:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,别事后再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}before you attach them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.51,0:15:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说这是为了鲍比·辛格 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said this was for Bobby Singer, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.01,0:15:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是为了他 不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well. I'm doing it for him, not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.27,0:15:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.77,0:15:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他救过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saved my life once.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.81,0:15:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,在弗拉格斯塔夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Flagstaff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.07,0:15:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搞砸了 他救了我 好吗 满意了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I screwed up and he saved me, okay? You satisfied?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.20,0:15:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.11,0:15:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们什么时候一起踏上这趟魔法神秘之旅\N{\fnArial\fs30}So when do we go on this little magical mystery tour?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.91,0:15:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哪都不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.58,0:15:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不放心让你上我的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't trust you enough to let you in my car,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.04,0:15:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,更别提进入鲍比的脑袋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}much less Bobby's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.37,0:15:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,别介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.58,0:15:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}None taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.30,0:15:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是凌晨2点 我去哪啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 2 a.m. Where am I supposed to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.26,0:15:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,去开间房嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.97,0:15:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有魔法手指\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got the Magic Fingers,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.80,0:15:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有付费色情片 你准喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Casa Erotica on pay-per-view. You'll love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.26,0:15:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.06,0:15:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴…见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to… Seeing you…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.02,0:15:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bela.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.15,0:16:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要把灯光调暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, should we dim the lights and.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.61,0:16:03.82,Title,0,0,0,0,,听着《月之暗面》 看《绿野仙踪》吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}synch up Wizard of Oz to Dark Side of the Moon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.91,0:16:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.12,0:16:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上大学时都干什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do during college?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.91,0:16:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.83,0:16:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不能落了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't forget this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.79,0:16:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.17,0:16:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.30,0:16:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比的头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby's hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.42,0:16:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得喝下鲍比的头发吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to drink Bobby's hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.72,0:16:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是控制你进入谁的梦境的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how you control whose dream you're entering.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.18,0:16:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得喝下他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to drink some of their…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.81,0:16:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,身体部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of their body.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.98,0:16:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,头发大概总比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, guess the hair of the dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.48,0:16:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他身体部分强\N{\fnArial\fs30}is better than other parts of the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.81,0:16:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bottoms up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.86,0:16:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.79,0:16:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,有感觉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.62,0:16:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.92,0:16:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有感觉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feel anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.29,0:16:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.51,0:17:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是东西不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we got some bad shwag.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.39,0:17:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候开始下雨的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did it start raining?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.32,0:17:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候开始下逆向雨的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did it start raining upside down?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.10,0:17:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我不知道哪个更怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I don't know what's weirder,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.16,0:17:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在鲍比脑子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}the fact that we're in Bobby's head…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.83,0:17:37.96,Title,0,0,0,0,,还是他梦到了《美好家园》杂志\N{\fnArial\fs30}or that he's dreaming of Better Homes and Gardens.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.96,0:17:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.19,0:17:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,想象这里没有上漆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine the place without the paint job.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.51,0:17:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,更凌乱 灰蒙蒙的 到处是书\N{\fnArial\fs30}More cluttered, dusty, books all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.51,0:17:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是鲍比家 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's Bobby's house. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.39,0:17:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.41,0:18:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.54,0:18:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.87,0:18:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去外面看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go look outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.12,0:18:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别分开\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, stay close.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.46,0:18:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 我没事的 我就到处看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, I'll be fine. Just look around in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.04,0:18:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we gotta find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.46,0:18:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,别干傻事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do anything stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.14,0:18:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.00,0:19:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.56,0:19:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.11,0:19:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.83,0:19:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.67,0:19:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 你在里面吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, you in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.76,0:19:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 嗯 是我 开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean? - Yeah. It's me. Open up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.35,0:19:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么找到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How in the hell did you find me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.93,0:19:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆和我拿到了那什么梦根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and I got our hands on some of that Dream Root stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.56,0:19:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,梦根 什么玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dream Root? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.27,0:20:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷格博士 他的实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Gregg, the experiments?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.48,0:20:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.31,0:20:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.17,0:20:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事 - 她来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going on? - She's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.48,0:20:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你知道这是梦境吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you know this is a dream, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.74,0:20:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you, crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.74,0:20:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是梦 鲍比 这都不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a dream, Bobby, none of this is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.12,0:20:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看那像假的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that look made-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.83,0:20:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 那是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.58,0:20:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,她…\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.25,0:20:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.78,0:20:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.24,0:20:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要这么对我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you do this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.89,0:21:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宁可死也不想伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would rather die myself than hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.25,0:21:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你是伤害了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you did hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.71,0:21:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿刀捅了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shoved that knife into me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.26,0:21:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,一遍又一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.30,0:21:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看着我流血\N{\fnArial\fs30}You watched me bleed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.01,0:21:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watched me die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.31,0:21:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.02,0:21:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她不是真的 - 你怎么能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- she's not real. - How could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.85,0:21:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被附身了 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were possessed, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.11,0:21:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当时都发狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were rabid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.44,0:21:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我当时不知道我现在知道的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I didn't know what I know now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.90,0:21:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道要怎么救你 - 你撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't know how to save you. - You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.53,0:21:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就想要我死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted me dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.03,0:21:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你爱我 你总会找到办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'd loved me, you would've found a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.20,0:21:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.96,0:21:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁 - 你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? - Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.26,0:21:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不属于这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't belong here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.30,0:21:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也好意思说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're one to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.59,0:21:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在我朋友脑袋里呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in my friend's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.72,0:22:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你真不会选朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you got a poor choice in friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.43,0:22:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是自卫 是他来找我麻烦的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is self-defense. He came after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.89,0:22:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想伤害我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted to hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.31,0:22:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是因为你杀人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe because you're a killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.69,0:22:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该对我更好些\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be nicer to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.06,0:22:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In here…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.86,0:22:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是个虫子 我是神\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're just an insect. I'm a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.74,0:22:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.03,0:22:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这房子 你妻子 都是噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your house, your wife, it's a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.45,0:22:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我杀了她 - 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I killed her. - Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.33,0:22:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的梦 你可以醒过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your dream that you can wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.75,0:22:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以做任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, hell, you can do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.54,0:22:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,放过我吧 让她杀了我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just leave me alone. Let her kill me already.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.09,0:22:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.67,0:22:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得马上醒过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna snap out of this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.88,0:22:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得马上醒过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta snap out of this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.47,0:22:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能死 我不能看着你死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna die. I'm not gonna let you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.22,0:22:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能看着你死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna let you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.14,0:22:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我就像个父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're like a father to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.76,0:22:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得相信我 求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta believe me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.14,0:22:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在做梦吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm dreaming? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.48,0:22:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制你的梦吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now take control of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.96,0:23:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.80,0:23:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.09,0:23:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可不可以醒过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now would you please wake up?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.01,0:23:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.67,0:23:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.12,0:23:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.12,0:23:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妻子的那事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That stuff with… all that stuff with your wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.62,0:23:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That actually happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.67,0:23:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都有开始猎魔的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody got into hunting somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.34,0:23:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很遗憾 - 不必\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - Don't be sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.51,0:24:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不是你 我还迷失在那里呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it weren't for you, I'd still be lost in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.14,0:24:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.85,0:24:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.86,0:24:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个瘾君子没在宿舍里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, stoner boy wasn't in his dorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.57,0:24:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜他早跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My guess is that he's long gone by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.28,0:24:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他可不是瘾君子 - 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He ain't much of a stoner. - No?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.36,0:24:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.49,0:24:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫杰里米·弗罗斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name's Jeremy Frost.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.12,0:24:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个天才 智商160呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full-on genius. Hundred-and-sixty IQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.87,0:24:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很不得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is saying something,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.66,0:24:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他爸爸曾拿棒球棒打过他的脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}considering his dad took a baseball bat to his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.21,0:24:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位就是他的年度好爹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's Father of the Year.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.04,0:24:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在杰里米10岁前就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He died before Jeremy was 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.71,0:24:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去真像个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like a real sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.88,0:24:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那伤导致他患上了夏-威二氏综合征\N{\fnArial\fs30}Injury gave him Charcot-Wilbrand,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.05,0:24:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他此后再没做过梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}he hasn't dreamt since.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.30,0:24:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到他服下了梦药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till he started dosing the dream drug.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.22,0:24:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.72,0:24:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么知道如何挖出你最可怕的噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd he know how to dig up your worst nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.39,0:24:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿来对付你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and throw it at you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.81,0:24:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在我脑袋里翻来翻去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was rooting around in my skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.52,0:24:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,天知道他在那里看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}God knows what he saw in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.89,0:24:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他最初是怎么进去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, how'd he get in there in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.35,0:24:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是需要有你的头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't he supposed to have your some of your hair,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.60,0:24:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,或DNA吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}your DNA or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.52,0:24:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.81,0:24:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道是他前 他递给过我啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before I knew it was him, he offered me a beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.94,0:25:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I drank it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.82,0:25:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是蠢极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dumbest frigging thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.78,0:25:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 也没那么蠢吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. It wasn't that dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.74,0:25:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.08,0:25:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我当时渴了 - 好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was thirsty. - That's great,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.62,0:25:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下他能找上你们俩任何一个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}now he can come after either one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.04,0:25:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就得先找到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now, we'll just have to find him first.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.17,0:25:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最好快点找\N{\fnArial\fs30}We better work fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.13,0:25:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要多喝咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}and coffee up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.84,0:25:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们绝不能睡着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because one thing we cannot do is fall asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.68,0:25:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个杰里米又不是鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, this Jeremy guy's not a frigging ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.43,0:25:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能去哪啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell could he be?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.27,0:25:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你真不需要我来开车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you sure you don't want me to drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.43,0:25:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你似乎有点…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem a little…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.19,0:25:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 咖啡喝多了 - 多谢你告知了 天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}- caffeinated. - Well, thanks for the news flash, Edison.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.53,0:25:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.90,0:25:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你有发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me you got something.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.07,0:25:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱衣舞俱乐部没收获吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strip club was a bust?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.53,0:25:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.28,0:25:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是最后的线索了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was our last lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.78,0:25:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.95,0:25:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,别吼我 小子 我也忙得团团转呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't yell at me, boy. I'm working my ass off here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.49,0:25:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我就是…累了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, I'm sorry. I'm just… I'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.87,0:25:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁不呢 - 贝拉有线索吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, who ain't? - What's Bela got?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.54,0:25:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你查到什么了吗 贝拉 - 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you got, Bela? - Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.63,0:26:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时鬼魂们喜欢聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes the spirit world is in a chatty mood,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.59,0:26:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sometimes it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.17,0:26:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她没发现 - 好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's got nothing. - Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.72,0:26:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我要去崩了自己的脑袋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm just gonna go blow my brains out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.81,0:26:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.52,0:26:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing helping us?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.36,0:26:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 你居然不记得了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, I'm surprised you don't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.94,0:26:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗拉格斯塔夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flagstaff?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.91,0:26:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.24,0:26:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.41,0:26:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗拉格斯塔夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flagstaff.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.48,0:26:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 行了 我受够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, that's it. I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.60,0:26:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.35,0:26:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡个早该睡的觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taking myself a long-overdue nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.06,0:26:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.77,0:26:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 杰里米可能会来找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, Jeremy can come after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.06,0:27:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就要这样 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's the idea. - Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.98,0:27:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 我们既然找不到他 就让他来抓我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man, we can't find him, so let him come to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.52,0:27:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他的地盘上吗 在他是个神的地方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}On his own turf? Where he's basically a god?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.03,0:27:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能应付得来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.24,0:27:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一个人不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not alone, you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.07,0:27:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.07,0:27:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming in with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.12,0:27:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不行 - 为什么不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, you're not. - Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.91,0:27:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少那样是两对一\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least then it'll be two against one.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.21,0:27:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我不希望你在我脑袋里转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause I don't want you digging around in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.96,0:27:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.89,0:27:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.60,0:27:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.15,0:27:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老天爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the love of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.07,0:27:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么还在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we still doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.69,0:27:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.66,0:27:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's someone out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.69,0:28:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要坐下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna sit down?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.90,0:28:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.61,0:28:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只有一小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}We only have an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.15,0:28:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就得接棒球练习结束的本了\N{\fnArial\fs30}before we have to pick Ben up from baseball.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.03,0:28:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从未做过这样的梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never had this dream before.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.87,0:28:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那么看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop looking at me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.04,0:28:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 - 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry. - Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.96,0:28:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.14,0:28:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,她去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.60,0:29:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.79,0:29:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.77,0:29:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.22,0:30:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰里米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeremy?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.08,0:30:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.83,0:30:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是个帅小伙儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, aren't you a handsome son of a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.58,0:30:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.58,0:30:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.54,0:30:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是自己最可怕的噩梦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm my own worst nightmare, that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.26,0:30:56.17,Title,0,0,0,0,,就像《超人3》里废品场的那段戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of like the Superman lll junkyard scene?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.17,0:30:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟自己对打吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little mano y mano with myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.72,0:31:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你怎么开玩笑 机灵鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joke all you want, smart-ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.47,0:31:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你无法对我撒谎 我知道真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can't lie to me. I know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.14,0:31:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你内心多枯萎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how dead you are inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.52,0:31:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得自己多没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}How worthless you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.81,0:31:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你看着镜子时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how you look into a mirror…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.57,0:31:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,恨自己的倒影\N{\fnArial\fs30}and hate what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.78,0:31:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 伙计 那没用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, pal, it's not gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.07,0:31:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not real.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.99,0:31:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.49,0:31:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是你 - 我看不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm you. - I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.75,0:31:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的睡梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, this is my siesta.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.17,0:31:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.59,0:31:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只需要弹个指响 你就消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I gotta do is snap my fingers and you go bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.64,0:31:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哪也不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.81,0:31:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也别想跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.15,0:31:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.61,0:31:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}we need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.07,0:32:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.33,0:32:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.88,0:32:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你就是不知道见好就收 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, you just don't know when to leave well enough alone, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.13,0:32:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a psycho.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.26,0:32:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.88,0:32:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 跟格雷格博士说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Tell that to Dr. Gregg.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.76,0:32:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doc?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.26,0:32:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 就是博士让我对这上瘾的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. The doc's the one that got me hooked on this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.72,0:32:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后又不让我用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then he took it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.89,0:32:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我需要它 而他不肯给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I needed it, and he wouldn't let me have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.90,0:32:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你就杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you killed him?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.48,0:32:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又能做梦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can dream again.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.77,0:32:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道那滋味吗 不能做梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what that's like, not to be able to dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.53,0:32:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远得不到真正的休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never rest, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.20,0:32:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉就像醒了15年\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like being awake for 15 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.37,0:32:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜猜 那把你逼疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And let me guess, that makes you go crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.74,0:32:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想被放过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanna be left alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.75,0:32:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想做梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanna dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.04,0:32:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.92,0:32:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,错误答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the wrong answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.14,0:33:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我越来越擅长这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting better and better at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.02,0:33:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,越来越强大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stronger and stronger all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.19,0:33:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你和你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you and your brother…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.15,0:33:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们醒不来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're not waking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.82,0:33:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.90,0:33:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让你们醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna let you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.28,0:33:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要下地狱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you're going to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.78,0:33:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都不肯想办法阻止吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you won't lift a finger to stop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.83,0:33:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么叫低自尊啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk about low self-esteem.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.25,0:33:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 你这条贱命大概也不值得拯救\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then again, I guess it's not much of a life worth saving.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.71,0:33:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒 迪恩 快醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up, Dean. Come on. Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.25,0:33:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟 除了萨姆 你什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, after all, you've got nothing, outside of Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.25,0:33:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.96,0:33:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就像只攻击犬一样无脑顺从\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're as mindless and obedient as an attack dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.30,0:33:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 才不是呢 - 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's not true. - No?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.85,0:33:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are the things that you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.72,0:33:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你梦想什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are the things that you dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.56,0:33:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的车 是爸爸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, your car, that's Dad's.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.02,0:33:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最喜欢的皮夹克 爸爸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your favorite leather jacket, Dad's.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.77,0:33:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢的音乐 是爸爸喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your music, Dad's.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.86,0:34:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有自己的想法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you even have an original thought?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.44,0:34:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.24,0:34:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就只有「照顾好萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, all there is is, "Watch out for Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.32,0:34:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,照顾好你弟弟 小子「\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look after your little brother, boy!"
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.87,0:34:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你脑袋里还能听到爸爸的声音 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can still hear your Dad's voice in your head, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.16,0:34:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 清晰响亮 - 闭嘴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Clear as a bell. - Just shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.37,0:34:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想看\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you think about it…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.50,0:34:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直在训练你\N{\fnArial\fs30}all he ever did was train you,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.04,0:34:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,使唤你\N{\fnArial\fs30}boss you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.46,0:34:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Sam…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.38,0:34:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 他很宠爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, he doted on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.76,0:34:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他爱萨姆 - 我说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam, he loved. - I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.89,0:34:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我越来越生气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.68,0:34:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸知道你究竟是什么样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad knew who you really were.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.60,0:34:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个好士兵而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}A good soldier and nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.94,0:34:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸的小钝器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy's blunt little instrument.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.69,0:34:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你亲生老爹都不在乎你的死活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your own father didn't care whether you lived or died.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.19,0:34:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你为什么要在乎呢 - 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why should you? - Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.57,0:34:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲是个执迷的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father was an obsessed bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.95,0:34:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他丢给我的一切 让我保护萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that crap he dumped on me, about protecting Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.54,0:34:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他的心结\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was his crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.66,0:34:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他无力保护家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the one who couldn't protect his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.54,0:35:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他眼看着妈妈死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the one who let Mom die.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.50,0:35:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他没有照顾萨姆 我一直都在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who wasn't there for Sam. I always was.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.05,0:35:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wasn't fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.96,0:35:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该因他承受这样的重担\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't deserve what he put on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.01,0:35:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不该下地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't deserve to go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.29,0:35:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别想逃过我 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't escape me, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.87,0:35:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.46,0:35:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这 就是你将变成的模样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this, this is what you're gonna become.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.38,0:35:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无法阻止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.92,0:35:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里无所不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing I can't do in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.17,0:35:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为梦根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of the Dream Root.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.80,0:35:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.59,0:35:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.84,0:35:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忘了件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're forgetting something.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.89,0:35:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.85,0:35:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也服了梦根\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took the Dream Root too.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.56,0:36:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰里米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeremy!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.44,0:36:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰里米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeremy!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.23,0:36:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.90,0:36:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.86,0:36:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 - 我跟你说话时 你要回答 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad? - You answer me when I'm talking to you, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.24,0:36:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.35,0:36:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也在那里编织梦境了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you did a little dream-weaving of your own in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.19,0:36:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我就集中了精神 然后就成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I just sort of concentrated and it happened, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.94,0:36:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,会不会是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't have anything to do with…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.57,0:36:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的灵力\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, your psychic stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.04,0:36:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.37,0:37:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.54,0:37:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.15,0:37:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们见到贝拉了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys seen Bela?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.39,0:37:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没在房间 也不接电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not in her room, she's not answering her phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.72,0:37:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,她肯定是走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She must've taken off or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.81,0:37:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,就那么走掉吗 奇怪啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like that? It's a little weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.02,0:37:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 要我说 奇怪的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Well, if you ask me, what's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.48,0:37:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,她为什么会答应帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}is why she helped us in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.65,0:37:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是说你救了她一命吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you saved her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.81,0:37:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.11,0:37:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗拉格斯塔夫那事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing in Flagstaff?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.07,0:37:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗拉格斯塔夫有个护身符\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing in Flagstaff was an amulet.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.70,0:37:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟她做了笔好交易而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave her a good deal, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.45,0:37:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那她为什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then why did…?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.00,0:37:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们最好摸摸兜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You boys better check your pockets.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.71,0:37:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是真让你们摸兜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.43,0:37:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.55,0:37:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯尔特枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.89,0:37:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉偷了柯尔特枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bela stole the Colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.68,0:38:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 小子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.43,0:38:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,收拾东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pack your crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.18,0:38:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,干吗 我们去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Where we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.73,0:38:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去找到那贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna go hunt the bitch down.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.55,0:38:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我想问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I was wondering.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.94,0:38:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在我脑袋里时 都看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you were in my head, what did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.20,0:38:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是杰里米 他把你我分开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just Jeremy. He kept me separated from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.32,0:38:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概那样打扁我的脑袋更轻松吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easier to beat my brains out that way, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.49,0:38:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢 你没提起过\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you? You never said.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.95,0:38:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 我一直找你来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. I was looking for you the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.17,0:38:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.34,0:38:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.72,0:38:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想了很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been doing some thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.30,0:38:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.60,0:38:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the thing is…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.85,0:38:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.65,0:38:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想下地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.49,0:39:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.95,0:39:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会想办法救你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find a way to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.08,0:39:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.17,0:39:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别想逃过我 迪恩 你死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't escape me, Dean. You're gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.55,0:39:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.55,0:39:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你将变成的模样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what you're gonna become.
